OL,3,GNEWSASection of M1 reopens after
OL,4,A'serious collision'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M1 has reopened
OL,7,Ffollowing a "serious collision",
OL,8,FNational Highways has said.
OL,10,FIt said at about 18:40 BST that the
OL,11,Fnorthbound carriageway was closed
OL,12,Fbetween Junction 23 and Junction 23
OL,13,Fnear Loughborough after a crash.
OL,15,FDrivers were warned of delays of an
OL,16,Fhour being reported on the approach to
OL,17,Fthe crash.
OL,19,FTwo lanes have since been reopened,
OL,20,Fwhile one remains closed to allow for
OL,21,Fvehicle recovery, National Highways
OL,22,Fsaid.
